			"notes": "Meteor integration preview for Minecraft 26.2. Built and validated on 2026-11-10; uploaded on 2026-11-21.\n\n## Downloads\nInstall **Lenrete-1.2.0-meteor-preview.4.jar** only, alongside Fabric API 0.156.0+26.2, Fabric Loader 0.19.3 and Java 25. Meteor 26.2-35 is included unchanged.\n\nUse **Lenrete-1.2.0-meteor-preview.4-release.zip** for the complete package with source, documentation, licenses and SHA256SUMS. The supplied **complete-source.zip** contains the exact preview.4 source and validation evidence; use it rather than GitHub's automatically generated source archives. The existing main-branch source and earlier releases are preserved.\n\n## Changes\n- Compact allay status markers with focus details and estimated cooldowns.\n- Native Allay Statistics HUD with estimated birth/kill/drop attribution, optional persistent totals and reset command.\n- CS2 Clean, Neon and Minimal visual/GUI presets; optional native Meteor Chams.\n- Guarded addon initialization, settings and widgets, shared categories, and duplicate registration protection.\n- Existing advancement/recipe Toast Suppression retained.\n\n## Validation and limits\n58 passing unit tests; actual packaged-client and singleplayer fixtures; addon/configuration restart checks; three preset frame-time measurements; 21 screenshots at two window sizes/GUI scales. These are the documented November 10 checks, not new multiplayer tests.\n\nMultiplayer/Eternel.eu remains unverified. Statistics are explicitly estimated. Skeleton rendering is schematic; glow applies to screen-space boxes. No universal addon or shader compatibility guarantee.\n\nThe optional test addon under test-tools in the full package intentionally contains failing fixtures: do not install it in a normal profile. See PREVIEW4.md and LENRETE_METEOR_PORT_REPORT.md for installation, migration, rollback and detailed evidence."
